WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.851
Exercise 2 asks you to create a preferred contact
value The priority

00:00:05.864 --> 00:00:10.144
should be email then mobile phone then home phone
But there is

00:00:10.169 --> 00:00:14.473
an extra requirement blank text or text containing
only spaces should count

00:00:14.499 --> 00:00:19.731
as missing Think about the two functions we just
practiced Use B

00:00:19.757 --> 00:00:24.975
trim and null if to normalize each candidate value
Then use coalesce

00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:29.474
to choose the first usable result A final text
fallback should be

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:34.858
used if no contact method is available You can
complete and test

00:00:34.884 --> 00:00:38.996
the SQL directly in the browser using Run and Check
You can

00:00:39.022 --> 00:00:42.437
also copy the starter code into pgAdmin if you want
a larger

00:00:42.462 --> 00:00:46.921
workspace or want to inspect the data separately
Once it works there

00:00:47.127 --> 00:00:49.937
paste your final answer back into the browser and
check it
